### Necessário para pegar o token
# @name loginAutenticado
POST http://localhost:43000/Login HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "UserName": "qwe",
    "Password": "qwe"
}

### Seta o token
@accessToken = {{loginAutenticado.response.body.$.token}}

### teste de buscar todos os registros
GET http://localhost:43000/getAllPiquetes HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### teste de buscar por ID
GET http://localhost:43000/getPiqueteByID/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### teste de buscar dados para o select
GET http://localhost:43000/getPastosToPiquetes HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### teste de inserção
POST http://localhost:43000/insertPiquete HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "descricao": "Piquete 3",
    "latitude": -20.4245,
    "longitude": -49.9801,
    "pastoidfk": 1
}

### teste de atualização
PUT http://localhost:43000/updatePiquete/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "descricao": "Piquete 1 (sombra)",
    "latitude": -20.4231,
    "longitude": -49.9781,
    "pastoidfk": 1
}

### teste de remoção (soft delete)
DELETE http://localhost:43000/deletePiquete/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
